# TopEdge marketing UI theme

Reference: homepage hero (`home.css`) + `PricingSectionHead` / `.mkt-psec__*`.

## Typography

### Page heroes (H1)
- **Font weight: 400** — never 500+ on the main hero line
- **Size:** `clamp(1.45rem, 2.8vw, 2.35rem)` — same as `.home-hero__title`
- **Letter-spacing:** `-0.034em`
- **Desktop:** one line — `white-space: nowrap` / `flex-wrap: nowrap` from `1024px` up
- **Mobile:** allow wrap

### Highlight capsule (`.mkt-psec__hl`, homepage `.home-hero__title-brand`)
- **Background:** solid `#e4d4ff` — not gray muted text, not heavy purple gradient
- **Text color:** `#0c1222` (ink), not `#5b21b6` on heroes
- **Font weight:** 400 on heroes
- **Padding:** `0.12em 0.28em 0.16em`, **radius:** `0.35em`

### Section headings (H2 — FAQ, Compare, Included, etc.)
- Use `PricingSectionHead` — do not hand-roll titles
- **Eyebrow:** uppercase, `#7c3aed`, `0.72rem`, letter-spacing `0.08em`
- **Title weight:** 400; highlight uses `.mkt-psec__hl`
- **Sub:** `#64748b`, ~`0.9375rem`

## Navbar (`.mkt-nav`)

- **Logo text:** `font-weight: 650`, keep company logo image (`/logo.png`) — never text-only
- **Nav links:** `font-weight: 600`, `font-size: 0.875rem`, color `#475569`
- **Link padding:** compact — `0.2rem 0.62rem`; do not inflate Product capsule
- **Active/hover:** purple→white gradient capsule `#ede9fe → #f5f3ff → #fff`, border `#ddd6fe`
- **Desktop:** no hamburger; show links + actions from `1024px`

## Color accents

- Primary purple: `#7c3aed` / `#6d28d9`
- Highlight block: `#e4d4ff`
- Ink: `#0c1222`
- Muted body: `#64748b`
- Borders: `#eef0f4`

## Do not

- Remove logo from navbar
- Use gray-only “muted” span for hero highlights instead of lilac capsule
- Make nav links thin (`font-weight: 500` or lower)
- Add hint text under cycle toggle (“Billed yearly…”) — Yearly tab only has inline **Save** chip
- Use purple background on billing cycle toggle — track is `#f8fafc`, active pill is white
- Use black CTAs on Growth — use **purple gradient** buttons
- Break hero title into two lines on desktop when it fits in one

## Components to reuse

| Pattern | Component / class |
|--------|-------------------|
| Section title | `PricingSectionHead` |
| Plan cards | `PlanGrid` + `.mkt-plan__shell` / `.mkt-plan__panel` |
| Comparison table | `FeatureMatrix` |
| FAQ | `PricingFaq` |
| ROI strip | `PricingRoiStrip` |
| Sales close | `PricingSalesCta` |

## Before shipping marketing UI changes

1. Hero title matches homepage weight/size/highlight
2. Navbar links are **600** weight with logo visible
3. Purple theme consistent (not teal/green except checkmarks in compare table)
4. Hard refresh and check desktop **1024px+** and mobile
